WEBVTT

00:00:02.020 --> 00:00:05.420
﻿Hey, Aina... what are you doing?

00:00:06.730 --> 00:00:09.360
﻿I said what are you doing, Aina!?

00:00:09.960 --> 00:00:11.960
﻿You must have the wrong person.

00:00:11.970 --> 00:00:15.100
﻿Her name is Aila, not Aina.

00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:17.000
﻿I don't care what her name is!

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:18.840
﻿Or that she hid being a fighter!

00:00:19.870 --> 00:00:22.740
﻿But I'll tell you one thing.

00:00:24.980 --> 00:00:27.410
﻿The way you fought back there...

00:00:28.210 --> 00:00:29.310
﻿I'll never forgive you!

00:00:30.920 --> 00:00:31.950
﻿We'll beat you!

00:00:31.950 --> 00:00:34.690
﻿In our next battle,
﻿we'll beat you for sure!

00:00:35.360 --> 00:00:39.060
﻿On the honor and pride
﻿of the royal house of Arian!

00:00:43.630 --> 00:00:45.060
﻿Arian...

00:00:45.730 --> 00:00:49.500
﻿Just as I thought,
﻿that boy's the prince of Arian...

00:00:50.170 --> 00:00:53.910
﻿Aria von Reiji Asuna!

00:02:24.930 --> 00:02:28.300
﻿So that really was Miss Aina.

00:02:28.900 --> 00:02:31.570
﻿But why give us a fake name?

00:02:31.940 --> 00:02:34.570
﻿Because she fights in such a cruel way,

00:02:34.570 --> 00:02:36.740
﻿maybe she didn't want us to know.

00:02:37.510 --> 00:02:39.640
﻿Yeah, the way she fought...

00:02:40.680 --> 00:02:42.880
﻿I barely know her yet.

00:02:42.880 --> 00:02:45.450
﻿But I can't believe Miss Aina, no,

00:02:45.950 --> 00:02:48.320
﻿Miss Aila would do such a thing.

00:02:49.320 --> 00:02:51.220
﻿Don't you think so, Kousaka?

00:02:51.220 --> 00:02:52.420
﻿Yes.

00:02:52.420 --> 00:02:57.260
﻿Maybe the suit she wears has
﻿some sort of special system.

00:02:57.960 --> 00:03:00.460
﻿Like the Berserker System in G Gundam?

00:03:01.200 --> 00:03:02.600
﻿No way.

00:03:02.600 --> 00:03:06.200
﻿You'd be disqualified for
﻿violating the tournament rules.

00:03:06.940 --> 00:03:09.610
﻿Then what other reason...

00:03:09.980 --> 00:03:11.510
﻿The reason doesn't matter.

00:03:12.440 --> 00:03:14.950
﻿She... That woman...

00:03:15.610 --> 00:03:19.620
﻿She's a darn Gunpla fighter
﻿who doesn't respect her opponent!

00:03:22.190 --> 00:03:23.990
﻿Do you really think that?

00:03:25.760 --> 00:03:27.690
﻿Are you okay with that, Reiji?

00:03:28.930 --> 00:03:31.030
﻿I don't care about her.

00:03:31.030 --> 00:03:32.930
﻿She's our enemy.

00:03:32.930 --> 00:03:35.400
﻿We'll simply wipe out this opponent
﻿in our next battle!

00:03:35.400 --> 00:03:36.670
﻿And that's all.

00:03:41.140 --> 00:03:43.240
﻿Why did this happen?

00:03:43.780 --> 00:03:47.040
﻿I think the one who's
﻿wondering that the most,

00:03:47.780 --> 00:03:49.580
﻿must be Reiji himself.

00:03:56.620 --> 00:03:57.890
﻿How is Aila?

00:03:58.560 --> 00:04:01.560
﻿Brainwaves and pulse are both normal.

00:04:01.560 --> 00:04:03.190
﻿Her body's perfectly healthy.

00:04:04.100 --> 00:04:08.670
﻿Then why did the synch rate of Aila and
﻿Embody drop in the quarterfinals?

00:04:09.170 --> 00:04:11.900
﻿It's probably a psychological thing.

00:04:11.900 --> 00:04:13.740
﻿The reason isn't clear, but...

00:04:13.740 --> 00:04:17.640
﻿she's subconsciously refusing
﻿to play Gunpla Battle.

00:04:18.240 --> 00:04:19.540
﻿She doesn't want to fight?

00:04:20.950 --> 00:04:23.550
﻿Is she affected by that boy Reiji?

00:04:25.320 --> 00:04:30.850
﻿The Flana Institute's masterpiece
﻿is weakened by a little crush?

00:04:41.600 --> 00:04:42.770
﻿She was right again!

00:04:43.100 --> 00:04:44.700
﻿Wow, Aila!

00:04:44.700 --> 00:04:47.610
﻿Like you said, the red Gunpla won.

00:04:47.610 --> 00:04:50.110
﻿Guessed it right 47 times in a row.

00:04:50.110 --> 00:04:52.180
﻿How do you know who'll win?

00:04:52.180 --> 00:04:54.210
﻿I want to know that, too.

00:04:55.610 --> 00:04:57.210
﻿Would you teach me?

00:04:58.680 --> 00:04:59.620
﻿I feel it.

00:05:00.250 --> 00:05:04.050
﻿I feel the glittering stuff
﻿flowing around that toy.

00:05:04.820 --> 00:05:08.460
﻿From the flow,
﻿I can tell what it'll do next,

00:05:08.460 --> 00:05:10.560
﻿and also which one is stronger.

00:05:11.500 --> 00:05:16.530
﻿She can sense the movement
﻿of the Plavsky particles...!?

00:05:17.570 --> 00:05:22.710
﻿Incredible. Instead of Gunpla
﻿building mastery or control skills...

00:05:23.210 --> 00:05:26.610
﻿This is a third talent.

00:05:28.850 --> 00:05:30.850
﻿The red one will move to the right.

00:05:30.850 --> 00:05:33.720
﻿The blue one will
﻿move down, then back.

00:05:33.720 --> 00:05:35.850
﻿Red will move forward,
﻿blue to the left...

00:05:36.690 --> 00:05:40.060
﻿Her accuracy rate is 87.3%.

00:05:40.060 --> 00:05:40.960
﻿Unbelievable.

00:05:42.090 --> 00:05:44.500
﻿We can use her.

00:05:44.500 --> 00:05:46.100
﻿Make it 100%.

00:05:46.970 --> 00:05:47.900
﻿We'll try.

00:05:49.230 --> 00:05:52.300
﻿Particle visibility rate is 99.97%.

00:05:52.870 --> 00:05:55.440
﻿Embody system is stable.

00:05:55.810 --> 00:05:57.610
﻿Embody.

00:05:57.610 --> 00:06:01.450
﻿It's a system that links
﻿with Aila's brainwaves...

00:06:01.450 --> 00:06:04.250
﻿and visualizes the particles
﻿on a head-mounted display.

00:06:04.650 --> 00:06:07.650
﻿It's like a supernatural
﻿precognitive ability.

00:06:08.850 --> 00:06:13.090
﻿Nobody can hurt a girl
﻿who can see the future.

00:06:13.660 --> 00:06:17.390
﻿Any possibility that Embody might be
﻿against the championship rules?

00:06:18.000 --> 00:06:21.700
﻿It won't respond when
﻿anyone else wears it.

00:06:21.700 --> 00:06:24.130
﻿As far as they can tell,
﻿it's just a cosplay outfit.

00:06:26.070 --> 00:06:28.110
﻿It's finally complete.

00:06:30.580 --> 00:06:32.010
﻿Aila,

00:06:32.010 --> 00:06:34.310
﻿we've devoted time and money to you.

00:06:35.510 --> 00:06:37.950
﻿Well do whatever it takes,

00:06:37.950 --> 00:06:41.220
﻿since we can't afford to lose.

00:06:48.460 --> 00:06:50.230
Reiji...

00:07:00.440 --> 00:07:01.570
﻿Darn.

00:07:01.840 --> 00:07:03.810
﻿How frustrating!

00:07:05.980 --> 00:07:08.080
﻿You seem to be in a bad mood.

00:07:10.480 --> 00:07:12.050
﻿Eh, Reiji?

00:07:12.420 --> 00:07:13.980
﻿Fellini.

00:07:15.420 --> 00:07:17.520
﻿Sorry about your battle today.

00:07:18.090 --> 00:07:20.090
﻿Yeah, thanks.

00:07:20.090 --> 00:07:21.430
﻿Leave the rest to us.

00:07:21.430 --> 00:07:24.700
﻿Sei and I will avenge you.

00:07:24.700 --> 00:07:26.700
﻿That darn Gunpla fighter...

00:07:26.700 --> 00:07:29.030
﻿It's none of your business.

00:07:29.030 --> 00:07:33.670
﻿Or do you need an excuse
﻿to battle with her?

00:07:35.310 --> 00:07:38.880
﻿If you have to hate your opponent
﻿when you battle, forget it.

00:07:40.480 --> 00:07:42.910
﻿So much for the Italian Dandy.

00:07:42.910 --> 00:07:45.880
﻿To think I fought to a draw
﻿with this snot-nosed kid.

00:07:45.880 --> 00:07:47.520
﻿Are you picking a fight?

00:07:47.850 --> 00:07:49.690
﻿Did you just get it now?

00:07:49.690 --> 00:07:51.460
﻿You're not very bright.

00:07:52.620 --> 00:07:54.360
﻿Fellini!

00:08:00.300 --> 00:08:03.830
﻿What're you doing, Aila?
﻿It's time for training.

00:08:03.840 --> 00:08:04.940
﻿I'm quitting.

00:08:05.470 --> 00:08:07.070
﻿What is this place?

00:08:07.070 --> 00:08:10.510
﻿Training and testing,
﻿day in and out.

00:08:11.240 --> 00:08:12.380
﻿I can't stand it.

00:08:13.410 --> 00:08:16.080
﻿You're paid more than enough for it.

00:08:16.080 --> 00:08:19.220
﻿If you're still unsatisfied,
﻿then go back home!

00:08:20.920 --> 00:08:23.490
﻿Back to that life of poverty!

00:08:24.060 --> 00:08:26.120
﻿O-Okay.

00:08:27.730 --> 00:08:30.160
﻿And correct your vulgar tongue.

00:08:30.500 --> 00:08:33.130
﻿I-I understand, Doctor.

00:08:55.890 --> 00:09:00.360
﻿Wearing this suit makes my head numb.

00:09:01.390 --> 00:09:04.600
﻿Why are they making me do this?

00:09:06.260 --> 00:09:08.930
﻿Who cares about Gunpla Battle?

00:09:09.700 --> 00:09:11.700
﻿It's ridiculous.

00:09:11.700 --> 00:09:15.270
﻿So ridiculous.

00:09:17.680 --> 00:09:20.540
﻿I just want a normal...

00:09:23.250 --> 00:09:24.450
﻿A normal...!

00:09:31.790 --> 00:09:33.160
﻿We'll beat you!

00:09:36.900 --> 00:09:37.900
﻿Is it hard?

00:09:41.930 --> 00:09:45.300
﻿If it's hard, close your eyes
﻿and cover your ears.

00:09:45.300 --> 00:09:48.970
﻿If you close your eyes,
﻿you don't have to see his face.

00:09:48.970 --> 00:09:52.240
﻿If you cover your ears,
﻿you don't have to hear him.

00:09:53.080 --> 00:09:54.910
﻿This is business.

00:09:54.910 --> 00:09:56.410
﻿Results are everything.

00:09:56.410 --> 00:09:58.650
﻿Forget your emotions.
﻿Don't be sentimental.

00:09:59.320 --> 00:10:02.690
﻿All you have to do is win.

00:10:03.960 --> 00:10:06.860
﻿Win the next match,
﻿and the ones after that.

00:10:11.360 --> 00:10:12.760
﻿Ouch, ouch.

00:10:12.760 --> 00:10:14.900
﻿M-More gently...

00:10:15.300 --> 00:10:17.770
﻿Fighting a kid? Really?

00:10:17.770 --> 00:10:21.570
﻿My words didn't reach him,
﻿I had no choice.

00:10:21.570 --> 00:10:23.870
﻿Especially since we're men.

00:10:24.380 --> 00:10:26.310
﻿You're too kind.

00:10:26.310 --> 00:10:28.550
﻿I did it to warn myself.

00:10:29.950 --> 00:10:31.350
﻿I want them to...

00:10:32.120 --> 00:10:35.450
﻿enjoy the battles,
﻿not fight with hatred.

00:10:38.120 --> 00:10:40.220
﻿Darn.

00:10:41.590 --> 00:10:43.890
﻿That darn Fellini.

00:10:43.900 --> 00:10:45.960
﻿What does he want me to do?

00:10:47.130 --> 00:10:49.170
﻿What should I do...

00:10:55.370 --> 00:10:57.240
﻿What can I do?

00:10:58.740 --> 00:11:03.110
﻿What is it that I can do
﻿for Reiji and Miss Aila?

00:11:11.490 --> 00:11:12.860
﻿Miss Baker!

00:11:13.160 --> 00:11:15.990
﻿It'll be okay this time, right?

00:11:16.590 --> 00:11:18.600
﻿Of course, Chairman.

00:11:18.600 --> 00:11:20.160
﻿No need for cheap tricks anymore.

00:11:20.870 --> 00:11:23.570
﻿Because their opponent is...

00:11:23.940 --> 00:11:26.940
﻿Aila Jyrkiainen, the undefeated legend.

00:11:29.440 --> 00:11:30.170
﻿Miss Aila!

00:11:33.340 --> 00:11:35.680
﻿Good luck in today's battle!

00:11:35.680 --> 00:11:37.410
﻿I'm cheering for you.

00:11:37.420 --> 00:11:39.950
﻿This is a charm for you.

00:11:40.920 --> 00:11:41.920
﻿Accept it.

00:11:44.390 --> 00:11:46.260
﻿We've got to get to our match.

00:11:46.260 --> 00:11:48.730
﻿Yes, sir. Thank you.

00:11:49.890 --> 00:11:51.930
﻿Start learning how to please fans.

00:11:52.560 --> 00:11:54.230
﻿Wear that on you.

00:11:54.230 --> 00:11:55.300
﻿Yes, sir.

00:12:00.710 --> 00:12:04.880
<i>﻿We now begin match one
﻿of the semifinals.</i>

00:12:05.940 --> 00:12:07.740
﻿- The time has come.
﻿- Yeah.

00:12:08.680 --> 00:12:10.210
﻿Sei and Reiji are coming.

00:12:11.550 --> 00:12:14.280
﻿Is Reiji alright?

00:12:14.290 --> 00:12:16.550
﻿He's pretty tough.

00:12:17.160 --> 00:12:20.490
﻿You fought with him,
﻿so you know that, right?

00:12:22.460 --> 00:12:23.390
﻿Yeah.

00:12:47.720 --> 00:12:49.050
﻿Hey, Sei.

00:12:49.050 --> 00:12:49.650
﻿What?

00:12:49.990 --> 00:12:53.690
﻿I thought hard, but
﻿I couldn't find an answer at all.

00:12:53.690 --> 00:12:54.860
﻿So...

00:12:55.260 --> 00:12:57.830
﻿I've decided not to think.

00:12:59.000 --> 00:13:01.060
﻿You don't mind, do you?

00:13:02.130 --> 00:13:02.670
﻿Fine!

00:13:03.500 --> 00:13:06.440
<i>﻿Beginning Plavsky particle dispersal.</i>

00:13:09.140 --> 00:13:11.340
<i>﻿Field 3, Forest.</i>

00:13:13.880 --> 00:13:15.510
﻿- Sei Iori.
﻿- Reiji.

00:13:15.750 --> 00:13:18.120
- ﻿Star Build Strike.
- ﻿Here we come!

00:13:31.100 --> 00:13:31.830
﻿Aina...

00:13:32.300 --> 00:13:34.530
﻿Or was that Aila?

00:13:34.530 --> 00:13:35.970
﻿Whatever.

00:13:36.530 --> 00:13:37.900
<i>﻿Finish it quick.</i>

00:13:40.810 --> 00:13:42.370
﻿Let's get going!

00:13:50.520 --> 00:13:51.110
﻿Fire the vulcans!

00:13:59.820 --> 00:14:02.490
﻿He put special paint in the shells?

00:14:03.090 --> 00:14:04.390
﻿That's our Mr. Sei!

00:14:04.660 --> 00:14:06.460
﻿If I can see them, they're nothing!

00:14:16.910 --> 00:14:17.640
﻿You're finished.

00:14:25.150 --> 00:14:26.820
﻿The Embody numbers are...

00:14:28.420 --> 00:14:29.220
﻿Fight, Aila!

00:14:29.890 --> 00:14:32.190
<i>﻿You want to go back to your old life!?</i>

00:14:35.530 --> 00:14:37.060
﻿Women are so hard to manage!

00:14:54.650 --> 00:14:56.850
﻿It's just like when she fought Mr. Fellini!

00:14:57.080 --> 00:14:58.380
﻿Bring it on!

00:15:17.500 --> 00:15:18.270
﻿She foresaw that?

00:15:37.190 --> 00:15:37.790
﻿Do it.

00:15:52.670 --> 00:15:53.270
﻿Aila!

00:16:05.180 --> 00:16:06.150
﻿I can't hit it!

00:16:07.350 --> 00:16:08.720
﻿Of course not.

00:16:08.890 --> 00:16:12.420
﻿Through the Embody,
﻿Aila can see the particle flow.

00:16:13.290 --> 00:16:15.660
﻿Finish it off, Aila!

00:16:17.830 --> 00:16:18.330
﻿No...

00:16:33.680 --> 00:16:34.480
﻿Iori!

00:16:37.950 --> 00:16:39.550
﻿Darn it!

00:16:41.690 --> 00:16:42.490
﻿No...!

00:16:47.220 --> 00:16:48.460
﻿What?

00:16:48.490 --> 00:16:49.960
﻿Help me.

00:16:49.960 --> 00:16:51.060
﻿This voice...

00:16:52.800 --> 00:16:54.060
﻿What's this!?

00:16:57.800 --> 00:16:59.800
﻿What's that light!?

00:16:59.800 --> 00:17:01.870
﻿The Plavsky particles are increasing!

00:17:02.310 --> 00:17:04.470
﻿Chairman, something is glowing!

00:17:08.710 --> 00:17:09.880
﻿Arista is...!

00:17:10.250 --> 00:17:12.020
﻿What's this phenomenon!?

00:17:12.020 --> 00:17:12.850
﻿This light...

00:17:13.350 --> 00:17:15.720
﻿Could it be the light of the heart?

00:17:22.830 --> 00:17:24.160
﻿It hurts...

00:17:25.130 --> 00:17:27.560
﻿My head hurts so bad.

00:17:27.970 --> 00:17:31.030
﻿I don't want to fight anymore!

00:17:31.970 --> 00:17:34.940
﻿You weren't doing it willingly?

00:17:34.940 --> 00:17:36.540
﻿Then you should quit.

00:17:36.540 --> 00:17:37.910
﻿I can't!

00:17:38.210 --> 00:17:40.880
﻿I don't have any family or relatives.

00:17:42.010 --> 00:17:44.410
﻿To survive, I have to fight.

00:17:44.720 --> 00:17:48.120
﻿Unless I win, I'll have nowhere to live.

00:17:48.420 --> 00:17:50.690
﻿You can live any place you want.

00:17:55.560 --> 00:17:59.230
﻿I'm also a drifter here,
﻿but l'm surviving.

00:17:59.230 --> 00:18:00.400
﻿Oh yeah!

00:18:00.400 --> 00:18:02.270
﻿Come to Sei's house.

00:18:02.270 --> 00:18:03.970
﻿I'm staying there, too.

00:18:03.970 --> 00:18:06.540
﻿They won't mind an extra person.

00:18:09.010 --> 00:18:10.440
﻿Are you serious?

00:18:11.210 --> 00:18:12.980
﻿I'm always serious.

00:18:38.440 --> 00:18:39.740
﻿Yeah.

00:18:41.540 --> 00:18:43.240
﻿You're always...

00:18:44.340 --> 00:18:46.280
﻿deadly serious.

00:18:56.850 --> 00:18:59.360
﻿The Embody number is zero!?

00:18:59.360 --> 00:18:59.990
Why?

00:19:02.160 --> 00:19:02.930
<i>﻿Oh, man.</i>

00:19:03.330 --> 00:19:05.730
﻿Why didn't you
﻿get it off your chest?

00:19:05.730 --> 00:19:07.600
﻿Why'd you hide your identity?

00:19:08.870 --> 00:19:09.500
﻿I mean...

00:19:10.500 --> 00:19:13.940
﻿You love playing Gunpla Battle.

00:19:14.210 --> 00:19:16.870
﻿But if you fight against me,
﻿I'll defeat you.

00:19:17.480 --> 00:19:20.340
﻿Then, we can't keep on—

00:19:20.340 --> 00:19:21.140
<i>﻿What!?</i>

00:19:21.710 --> 00:19:24.110
﻿I'm the one who's gonna win.

00:19:24.120 --> 00:19:25.280
﻿You fool!

00:19:26.550 --> 00:19:30.190
﻿Wh-Who are you calling a fool!?

00:19:32.220 --> 00:19:34.320
<i>﻿You're the fool!</i>

00:19:34.730 --> 00:19:36.690
<i>﻿Say that again!?</i>

00:19:36.960 --> 00:19:39.630
﻿<i>Fool! Fool! Your punch is weak!</i>

00:19:40.630 --> 00:19:42.530
<i>﻿You were crying just now!</i>

00:19:42.830 --> 00:19:45.470
<i>﻿No, I wasn't!</i>

00:19:45.670 --> 00:19:46.670
<i>﻿You were!</i>

00:19:46.670 --> 00:19:48.370
<i>﻿I told you, no!</i>

00:19:48.670 --> 00:19:49.910
﻿Is this a lover's spat?

00:19:49.910 --> 00:19:53.310
﻿I told him to enjoy the battle,
﻿not flirt his way through it.

00:19:53.510 --> 00:19:56.110
﻿I thought you wanted
﻿to quit Gunpla Battle.

00:19:56.110 --> 00:19:57.480
<i>﻿Never!</i>

00:19:57.650 --> 00:19:59.920
﻿Not until I smash you to pieces!

00:20:00.720 --> 00:20:01.990
﻿Stop it, Aila!

00:20:01.990 --> 00:20:04.890
﻿No! I won't listen to you anymore!

00:20:05.220 --> 00:20:07.160
<i>﻿Aila, What're you doing!?</i>

00:20:07.160 --> 00:20:08.420
﻿Shut up, old geezer!

00:20:08.430 --> 00:20:11.330
﻿Kid, if you want to win
﻿at Gunpla Battle,

00:20:11.330 --> 00:20:12.930
﻿play it yourself!

00:20:12.930 --> 00:20:13.860
<i>﻿Y-Yes!</i>

00:20:15.230 --> 00:20:16.630
﻿Let's go, Reiji.

00:20:16.630 --> 00:20:19.740
﻿I'll show you how strong I am,
﻿when I'm battling in earnest.

00:20:20.940 --> 00:20:22.570
<i>﻿Watch me!</i>

00:20:22.870 --> 00:20:23.940
﻿That's the spirit!

00:20:34.080 --> 00:20:35.820
﻿Sei, use the RG!

00:20:35.820 --> 00:20:36.690
<i>﻿Y-Yes, sir!</i>

00:20:44.300 --> 00:20:48.430
<i>﻿Build Knuckle!</i>

00:20:49.500 --> 00:20:50.400
﻿Useless.

00:20:50.940 --> 00:20:55.270
﻿I can feel the particles!
﻿An attack like that will never hit me.

00:20:56.470 --> 00:20:58.210
﻿What's this!?

00:20:58.880 --> 00:21:00.140
﻿I can't dodge it!

00:21:00.380 --> 00:21:03.280
﻿Take this, Aila!

00:21:16.860 --> 00:21:18.630
<i>﻿Battle ended.</i>

00:21:20.860 --> 00:21:24.500
﻿This is real Gunpla Battle.

00:21:26.070 --> 00:21:29.840
﻿I see. I'm not special after all.

00:23:03.600 --> 00:23:06.340
﻿Kousaka, thanks for the silly errand.

00:23:06.870 --> 00:23:07.870
﻿Not at all.

00:23:07.870 --> 00:23:11.240
﻿That was all I could do for them.
﻿I wasn't sure if it would work.

00:23:12.740 --> 00:23:15.850
﻿But I just hoped that...

00:23:16.580 --> 00:23:19.180
﻿Miss Aila's wishes would reach Reiji.

00:23:22.650 --> 00:23:24.190
﻿We won.

00:23:24.190 --> 00:23:27.460
﻿Yeah, I lost... this time.

00:23:27.930 --> 00:23:31.890
﻿Anyway, you'll keep
﻿your promise, right?

00:23:31.900 --> 00:23:34.030
﻿Promise? What promise?

00:23:34.670 --> 00:23:37.630
﻿You said if I had nowhere to go,
﻿I could come to Sei's house!

00:23:38.670 --> 00:23:40.600
﻿Oh, that.

00:23:40.800 --> 00:23:43.540
﻿W-Wait!
﻿You can't make a promise like that!

00:23:44.170 --> 00:23:45.810
﻿It's okay, right?

00:23:47.310 --> 00:23:48.640
﻿Thank you, Sei.

00:23:48.650 --> 00:23:50.110
﻿Getting familiar already!?

00:23:50.580 --> 00:23:52.550
﻿Misaki!

00:23:52.550 --> 00:23:54.880
﻿Shut up!

00:23:55.660 --> 00:23:57.100
﻿The man they call Meijin...

00:23:57.100 --> 00:24:00.230
﻿will fight another man
﻿closer to being a Meijin.

00:24:00.230 --> 00:24:02.470
Next episode, "Meijin vs Meijin".

00:24:02.470 --> 00:24:04.970
The two "M"s rise to their feet.
